ot; whereas  <b>Section</b> 135  deals with offence\n   of theft if he is found to have", "docsize": 21699, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Jharkhand High Court", "author": "G K Choudhary", "authorEncoded": "g-k-choudhary"}, {"tid": 122260542, "catids": null, "doctype": 1013, "publishdate": "2024-09-25", "authorid": null, "bench": null, "title": "Assistant Executive Engineer vs P.M.Joseph on 25 September, 2024", "numcites": 12, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "Commission for supply of <b>electricity</b> and allied services;\n \n             (iv) errors in billing; (v) erroneous disconnection of supply;\n \n             (vi) <b>electricity</b> services which are unsafe or hazardous ... 17725/2017 \n                                         ..7..\n \n                       (1) <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b> as provided under  <b>Section</b>\n                      <b>126</b>  of the Act;\n \n                       (2) offences and penalties as provided under  <b>Sections</b>", "docsize": 29099, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Kerala High Court"}], "found": "211 - 220 of 884", "encodedformInput": "%22section%20126%22%20electricity%20%22unauthorised%20use%22%20doctypes%3Ahighcourts"}